Here’s my script to create snapshots of a LightSail instance. Create daily or weekly snapshots.
#!/bin/bash if [ $1 != &#39;&#39; ]; then prefix=$1 timestamp=$(date +%s) snapshotname=$prefix&#39;_web-server_&#39;$timestamp /usr/local/bin/aws lightsail create-instance-snapshot \ --instance-snapshot-name $snapshotname \ --instance-name web-server else echo &#39;Need one argument. e.g. daily or weekly&#39; fi Crontab. Job can be scheduled daily or weekly.
